		Legendary: {
			1: Chain Lightning: 30% chance to arc to 2 nearby enemies on hit
			2: Ignite: applies On Fire! on hit
			3: Bloodthirst: heal 3% of damage dealt
			4: Executioner: killing blows explode for 100% damage in an area
			5: Piercing: projectiles pierce 1 extra target
			6: Split: projectiles split into 2 with 20% chance
			7: Sky Thunder: call down lightning every 3 seconds
			8: Thorns: reflect 50% of damage taken
			9: Cleave: melee hits splash 75% damage in an area
			10: Frenzy: +25% damage while below 30% life
